# Docker does not read .gitignore, and `COPY . .` in the runner Dockerfile
# happens *after* `npm ci` has installed Linux binaries into the image.
#
# Without this file, anyone who has run `npm install` or `npx playwright test`
# in this directory on their own machine ships a host `node_modules` into the
# build context, and the copy overwrites the tree npm just built — on macOS,
# darwin binaries inside a noble image. The failure is at run time, as a module
# that will not load, not at build.
node_modules
report
playwright-report
test-results
.gitignore
